  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD Operational Grant-Drought Emergency Response in Marsabit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project covers CAFOD operational costs for the Drought Emergency response (DER)in Marsabit, which is a 1 year project.
CAFOD is best suited to manage this internal grant for effective delivery of Drought Emergency Response project outcomes and goal.  Specifically the operational costs covered under this grant include: Travel, accommodation and Venue , Supplies, Materials and other Services CAFOD will directly pay for during the implementation period such as Grant start up, Baseline survey, CAFOD monitoring and final project evaluation.</narrative>
  </description>
